  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_01",
      "hash64": "44C3221A7E778DAF",
      "text": "Thank you again for your outstanding work on\\nOperation Starfall.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_02",
      "hash64": "44C3231A7E778F62",
      "text": "I cannot tell you how relieved I am that we were\\nable to help Miss Penny as we did.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_03",
      "hash64": "44C3241A7E779115",
      "text": "And I know she is exceedingly grateful to you for\\nyour part in all this.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_04",
      "hash64": "44C31D1A7E778530",
      "text": "So, I have one more thing to ask of you—though\\nthe request is admittedly of a delicate nature.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_05",
      "hash64": "44C31E1A7E7786E3",
      "text": "Do you think you could continue being good\\nfriends with Miss Penny as you have thus far?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "CF8A472FB375DBB6",
      "text": "You bet!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "CF8A462FB375DA03",
      "text": "Sure—we’re best buds!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_06",
      "hash64": "44C31F1A7E778896",
      "text": "I must say...I truly am glad to have you as one\\nof my students at the academy.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_07",
      "hash64": "44C3201A7E778A49",
      "text": "I believe you’ve more than earned this small\\ntoken of my appreciation.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_08",
      "hash64": "44C3291A7E779994",
      "text": "I hope that you will always stay just as wonderful\\nas you are now, M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0305"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_system_01",
      "hash64": "F469CCFE7E6AD0E1",
      "text": "You formed a close bond with Director Clavell!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
